# Binary Files
Binaries/*
Plugins/**/Binaries/*

# Builds
Build/*

# Whitelist PakBlacklist-<BuildConfiguration>.txt files
!Build/*/
Build/*/**
!Build/*/PakBlacklist*.txt

# Don't ignore icon files in Build
!Build/**/*.ico

# Built data for maps
*_BuiltData.uasset

# Configuration files generated by the Editor
Saved/*

# Compiled source files for the engine to use
Intermediate/*
Plugins/**/Intermediate/*

# Cache files for the editor to use
DerivedDataCache/*

# 忽略UE自动生成的ExternalActors文件夹（旧的大世界关卡用，减小仓库体积）
# 只忽略 Content/ 下按关卡名分的每个子文件夹，不用不限定路径的写法，
# 这样才能精确放行下面指定的那一个关卡，而不会把其他关卡（NewMap/OpenWorld）也一起放出来
Content/__ExternalActors__/*
Content/__ExternalObjects__/*
# 但 VoxelSandbox 下的关卡体积很小，且这些外部Actor文件里存着关卡实际需要的Actor数据
# （比如 VoxelWorld、PlayerStart），必须提交，否则关卡clone下来是坏的
!Content/__ExternalActors__/VoxelSandbox/
!Content/__ExternalObjects__/VoxelSandbox/

